# Comments in Java

Comments are notes written in source code that are ignored during normal compilation.

### Single-line comment

```java
// This is a comment
```

### Multi-line comment

```java
/*
   This is a
   multi-line comment
*/
```

### Documentation comment

```java
/**
 * This is a documentation comment.
 */
```

Comments are useful for explaining code and making programs easier to maintain.

